@podgp_heatmap_fig shows, for the worst-KL condition on each phase, the ground truth field, the POD+GP prediction, and the absolute error
painted on the aircraft surface. @podgp_slice_fig1 and @podgp_slice_fig2 show, for the same two conditions, the error-weighted PCA slices 

